{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_title", "source_sha256": "652c15dd213a614f0d28a79192e31295ec2dcccca44e4d821de6d2fb6af65c1e", "ja": "ほうき星は知っていた", "zh": "扫帚星早已知晓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3229e2bba2989c7a9fa42c703cc4edc592aadbdf2663b82045c99f3cf96e1f52", "ja": "ロック界隈で知名度がアップし何かと好調な\nジュリア。だが定期公演前、新レーベルへの\n移籍話を聞いてしまいショックを受ける。\n仲間達に背中を押されたジュリアは、意を\n決してプロデューサーに真意を問う。", "zh": "在摇滚界知名度上升、各方面都顺风顺水的\n茱莉亚。但在定期公演前，却因听到了转投\n新唱片公司的传闻而大受打击。\n在同伴们的鼓励下，茱莉亚下定决心，\n前去向制作人询问真正的用意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1000_null", "source_sha256": "4fabac51893813d31ef650ff8dfd6a17b69e707d7fed517b4a20e33bdc9aaf0e", "ja": "定期公演のミーティングから数日後……", "zh": "定期公演的会议结束几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "0355e03d7c9781a62074efab2564ee78bb64e224b2c12148c10eb992e8e5cef4", "ja": "まいったな……サッパリだ。\nこんなに何も浮かばないとは……。", "zh": "真伤脑筋啊……完全没头绪。\n没想到竟然什么都想不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "778794d56310959f3d50a0752d6633bf6f35c291cea21fe7a000e6929e38e5f8", "ja": "ここに来れば、何か思いつくかと思ったけど。\nもうレッスンが始まる時間だな。", "zh": "我还以为来到这里，就能想到些什么。  \n已经到该开始训练的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "8f2bea3e4fd6c3651f990531d74c9eba65778d61ba129cf6c844aa6c8c020851", "ja": "（なんか、あれから{$P$}と顔が\n合わせ辛いんだよな。避けてるわけじゃないんだけど）", "zh": "（总觉得从那以后，就有点难和{$P$}对上脸了。倒也不是在躲着他。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "a056c127d715203d2141d8a86f87051d8ea95983043228cd5ff7969509d95066", "ja": "だいたい、勝手なんだよ。あたしをスカウトして\nアイドルにしたのは、そっちのくせに……。", "zh": "说到底，都是你自作主张。明明是你把我挖来当偶像的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "b931e12a3a8e09e3156cb9d9fecc7bbb81e6045d860922271e1eff03edc2e335", "ja": "大人なら責任持て！　こっちは慣れないダンスだの、\nフリフリ衣装まで着てるんだぞ！　それなのに……。", "zh": "身为大人就负起责任来啊！我这边可是连不习惯的舞蹈也跳了，\n花里胡哨的衣服都穿上了！结果却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f9863a29e6c70be251afaf2efd1cbb866b003605ad532ac9af23ca2fdf1b18e2", "ja": "「いいお話だと思います。\nぜひ、前向きに検討を……」", "zh": "「我觉得这是一件好事。\n请务必积极考虑……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf774821b411bf656bbca396307794ddf8b5f61fc1a1d13c619092af1bf9a70d", "ja": "……それなのに、今さら\n新しいレーベルに行け、だって？", "zh": "……可即便如此，现在才说要我去新的唱片厂牌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e6fc5a57d47de1775b11a7471dc6669a4f154f685015112927d922c5ed0a952", "ja": "そんな簡単に、移籍とか……\nあたしを手放してもいいってことかよ……。", "zh": "这么轻易就说什么转会……你这是觉得放手让我走也无所谓吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "2dc924a5dd2df2e73c87dc2c22af0f1b2473b113880febcda386dc7748f73d49", "ja": "……くそ。バカP……。", "zh": "……可恶。笨蛋P……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
