{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a7a4f511dc17a0eb05640ba77ffa6114baea486d11c4e1e4fe35c5df129648f3", "ja": "あれ、ジュリア？　ずいぶん早いな。", "zh": "哎，茱莉亚？来得挺早啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "580ab1909a8d2f8da76c2c582192031400dec05975ae3b9619757d0aa3d2cb23", "ja": "ヒェッ！？　ななな、なんだよ\n{$P$}！", "zh": "呃！？你你你、干什么啊\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3dbbec5a8bbfb40ac3b540136e09e783fdc8a1c329bf5e4292f98a2082773f9c", "ja": "？　いや、レッスンの計画表ができたから、\n持ってきただけだけど……。", "zh": "？不是，我只是因为练习计划表已经做好了，\n所以拿过来而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c8985a9d5e036d57b97200a1b42887a751b1e3eb8ba802cda7fb21e8785a1770", "ja": "急な打ち合わせが入ったから出かけるけど、今日は\n全体曲だけだし。レッスンは任せて大丈夫だよな？", "zh": "我临时要去开个会所以得出门一趟，不过今天\n只有全体曲。练习就交给你了，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
