{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "2d0708da6681ce0477e75b33cc565d55323ad88f885399866e71700088a98815", "ja": "あ、あんたこそ。\nあたしに、話すことがあるんじゃないのかよ……？", "zh": "啊、你才是。\n你不是有话要跟我说吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1813aae7246061b74e28110254c87c01f2040b2c10f8f023e155280b44e5592b", "ja": "え？　ああ、もしかして新レーベルの事か？\nいい話だと思ったから、早速社長にも話してきたよ。", "zh": "诶？啊，你说的难道是新厂牌的事吗？\n因为我觉得这是个好消息，所以已经马上去跟社长谈过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1021_p", "source_sha256": "903d330951d624f72a8cfc277f84b09684e1e70bf9112a967e6c5b9b1066e0fd", "ja": "是非、進めてほしいってさ。\n細かい事は、もう少し詳細が決まってからだな。", "zh": "他们说希望我们尽快推进。\n细节的话，等更多详情确定下来再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1022_p", "source_sha256": "449e5e07a3397f9fc193cf064b01d53856793855a88095a033c128e9a6dfafc5", "ja": "じゃ、行ってくる！", "zh": "那我先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4feec0bd029693d37828637de2c6542a18a540876fa9eaccbc94fd9bae4f932", "ja": "あっ、ちょっ……{$P$}！？\nマジか、行っちまった……。", "zh": "啊，等、等一下……{$P$}！？  \n真的假的，居然走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "574417c28d50131137bb1b50b4966449ffe7fc7995ef7f2054bf5344ce37fec1", "ja": "そんな大事な話を、詳細が決まったらって……\nあたしには、説明する必要がないってか？", "zh": "这么重要的事，却说等细节定下来再告诉我……\n难道是觉得没必要向我解释吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "f7f4054edb932228f3548c6f93567e2c1a1c4118650f425aeb50a2824a88d700", "ja": "あんたは、他の大人とは違うと思ってたのに……\nこんなとこで急に、子ども扱いすんのかよ……。", "zh": "我还以为你和其他大人不一样呢……\n竟然在这种时候突然把我当成小孩子看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1026_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "02bf0660fe465bc7b7db078a55669a676e6aab90b84ad9f06fe1b1f960237219", "ja": "ねえねえ、ジュリア～ノ～。\n新曲、どうするか決めた？", "zh": "喂喂，茱莉亚～喏～。  \n新歌要怎么安排，决定好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc8196f56a29537d313c08475585a45aff37fd423dc6676f4fdfa24c2ac1abf5", "ja": "や、決まってない……。\nていうか、なんでそんな気になるんだよ？", "zh": "没，还没定下来……\n话说回来，你怎么这么在意啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a911f580039d89a9264ffe7033dad8c543165bb27b704a151243c7d84a0bb81", "ja": "だって、楽しみなんだも～ん。\nね、ロコちゃん！", "zh": "因为人家很期待嘛～\n对吧，ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "b84f8c6d9397daf663991704757ecab82951abd067b60c47268d2355ad7afbdb", "ja": "はい！　ジュリアの新曲、\nロコも気になってますよ～。", "zh": "是的！我也很期待茱莉亚的新歌，\n也很在意ROCO哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0be59e22ae0d6b6d18a027d4c1e7de804b7ff34242878a5f9a99959e8751a114", "ja": "ちょっとくらい、ヒントとかないの？\nジャンルとか～。", "zh": "就不能透露一点提示之类的吗？比如曲风～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
