{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "8bfc7887c3daaf78d62bc6eb2ec1283eff239755a2fbd353e013f11947bd4541", "ja": "……？　ジュリアちゃん。\nもしかして、ロックに不満があるとか？", "zh": "……？茱莉亚。\n难道说，是对摇滚有什么不满吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "fb4d8c6cee718da690ce4b9b058231a018146d3cd0ce8aab44d72a71448f2683", "ja": "いや、不満ってわけじゃない。期待には応えたいし、\nロックが求められているなら何よりだ。", "zh": "不是不满。我也想回应大家的期待，\n既然大家需要摇滚，那当然最好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "4ccf110006da82897b83664fe03dea1c26b4def2bc677dcc4d63fc48eb97b2f3", "ja": "けど、何ていうか……うーん。\nこういうの、どう言ったらいいのかな……。", "zh": "不过，该怎么说呢……嗯——这种感觉，要怎么形容才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "c391ca0341d9c1dc10fbde378774f4cadc7de6ab4b216e659a0fb9ebeacf838f", "ja": "なるほど、つまりスランプですね！\nノープロブレムですよ、ジュリア！　任せてください！", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，你遇到瓶颈了吧！\n没问题，茱莉亚！交给洛可吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1039_025roc", "source_sha256": "849e45c6f90a1bd53a5f6f5b172b25909ce8a787f878599069907d8fa8a21dd0", "ja": "クリエイターに、スランプはつきものですからね。\nスランプ脱出のメソッド、ロコがティーチしますよ♪", "zh": "创作者嘛，难免会遇到瓶颈。\n摆脱瓶颈的方法，就由ROCO来教你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "d985714cdf33b7e0c371af3cd2089bcea3c8e0a50feee6d28cc6fa0683de6858", "ja": "私も相談に乗るよ！\nこう見えて、いちおう先輩だもん。", "zh": "我也可以帮你出出主意！别看我这样，好歹也是前辈嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "9ed71d87fec02b644173a0c0b4f07225970a992b4cf4d6f9e769b84bd00be189", "ja": "困った時は、みんなと話し合えるといいよね。\nあとは{$P$}さんに相談したり……。", "zh": "遇到困难的时候，能和大家一起商量就好了呢。\n还有就是找{$P$}先生商量之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "57821a6c72fe1ba92a3250a9aaff51fd1a816914eee2ab87cbbd8469d1bf0ff4", "ja": "{$P$}か……。\nうーん……。", "zh": "{$P$}啊……\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "355c4d7e7583889093a88017a0b255312d20d8695cea68c8758c6960727e1522", "ja": "？　ジュリアちゃん、もしかして\n{$P$}さんとケンカしたとか？", "zh": "？茱莉亚，难道你和{$P$}先生吵架了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "18b4658c6c5f2e2f0958cf017af33899f08fd127f08f33defc3b9839f2b96b14", "ja": "え！！？\nいやっ、ケンカとか、そんなことは……。", "zh": "诶！！？\n不！才没有吵架什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "7f79ddd9fdc8dac1e594c3a4da8f6e6eee34bcc89bf260585030d9d12b9cae5d", "ja": "つーか、ケンカにもなんないっていうか……\nはは……。", "zh": "话说回来，应该说连架都吵不起来吧……\n哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "4f0a77c84916001f6c01a3e5b4cde55f8a2d3115c063c2812fd5107a6cae8635", "ja": "なるほど……わかったよ。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
