{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "2b25999b5448bcea7d094b8a25520f5346997d115b5fe57f990160d12a8da227", "ja": "なるほど、カロリーね……\nえっ？　か、カロリー。", "zh": "原来是卡路里啊……\n诶？卡、卡路里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1050_019min", "source_sha256": "7cfff7825c01bcd805767e421c4be20d66269ba8f4073981175381a293d788d2", "ja": "ほら、考え事するとカロリーを消費するでしょ？\nカロリーが足りないと、悪いほうに考えちゃうし！", "zh": "你看，动脑子会消耗热量吧？\n热量不够的话，就会往坏处想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "0925d4970ec1ce50b933a563436ca66d787cdd617ad30df574d40e87412783b0", "ja": "お、おう……？　そう……なのか……？", "zh": "哦、哦……？是……这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1052_019min", "source_sha256": "31a42c90adcee9effc1517e1e86bb3d42336c72d0e8c48016840b97f4a475fe1", "ja": "カロリーが足りないなら、\n解決方法はひとつだよ♪", "zh": "要是热量不够，\n解决办法就只有一个哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1053_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1054_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e38c07ab7f513482a0de0710f07258a57606eafb8f0e0f6493ce352f43eec24d", "ja": "ふぅ、お腹いっぱい！\n美奈子さん、ごちそうさまでした♪", "zh": "呼，吃得好饱！\n美奈子，谢谢你的款待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1055_025roc", "source_sha256": "1e027c75bd27101523ef41e945b0eceb9be47480a467c18a16b53168c353a29f", "ja": "ロコもお腹いっぱいです……。ミナコ、麻婆豆腐も\nスプリングロールも、とってもヤミーでした～。", "zh": "ROCO也吃得很饱了……美奈子，麻婆豆腐和春卷都特别好吃～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1056_019min", "source_sha256": "5c16882acc27788e4147e44d40f9353fd18067c30fea7b48052a171c8bee5bc6", "ja": "どういたしまして♪　……さてと。\nお腹もいっぱいになったし、そろそろ本題に入ろっか♪", "zh": "不用客气♪……好了。\n肚子也吃饱了，差不多该进入正题啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1057_019min", "source_sha256": "fc3c1d909304957dcc828bc3aeb093d51ae76fe7090510f71e69d6b85da7d2ca", "ja": "それで、ジュリアちゃんは、\n本当は何を悩んでるのかな？", "zh": "那么，茱莉亚，你其实在烦恼什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1058_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3e8d72deaf7644516de66b9092d2a991172d0c0c4e5ce0a6fd22b795a731315", "ja": "えっ。……と、それは……。", "zh": "诶……这个嘛……行不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1059_001har", "source_sha256": "0ef348b2be43beef8cca22bf1f9f85ba6bd26a283c63018c87e1e17fb5f967e8", "ja": "あっ、やっぱり？\n私もそう思ったんだ！", "zh": "啊，果然是这样？\n我也是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1060_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8068b1e8fef82595c0614d61326d7250aa9f52fbe6d87b7337034e8fa4dee795", "ja": "ジュリアーノ、スランプじゃなくて悩みがあったの？\nなんかヘンだと思った～。", "zh": "茱莉亚，不是陷入低谷，而是有烦恼吗？我就觉得有点奇怪～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1061_050jul", "source_sha256": "b81ff4ac3a8a8b62cf544b5536840b039a87cfc907456b3f872a290e60390fd1", "ja": "そ、それは……ていうか、\nヘンだと思われてたのか……。", "zh": "那、那个……话说回来，\n原来你觉得我很奇怪啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1062_019min", "source_sha256": "beaeda3fb87b61d0ab461eb4c8ce110f93c63f72c83036e8aeec893bec5ce9eb", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、前、私に言ってくれたよね？\n「そんなことで遠慮する間柄じゃない」って。", "zh": "茱莉亚，你之前也对我说过吧？\n“我们之间不用因为这种事客气。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1063_019min", "source_sha256": "c015f40d63c82fb256a3e5749c675fdb39f7cdf75c7f3bc274e701f10deb34ac", "ja": "それって、今のジュリアちゃんもじゃないかな？", "zh": "现在的茱莉亚不也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1064_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f599a4b34795a7b14f2e88302cd74d2648040a80c7afb2b3ce4d05a3f876bfd", "ja": "ジュリアーノって、けっこう気つかうよね。\nロッカーなのに。", "zh": "茱莉亚诺，还挺会替别人着想的嘛。\n明明是摇滚歌手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1065_050jul", "source_sha256": "063a1fb2a65e14a8be167c85ee486ffc4d7573c13fd5f23caa7a5b53ecea0dcc", "ja": "ロッカーだから気遣うんだよ！　ロックが\n好きだからって、常識がないとか思われたくないだろ。", "zh": "正因为我是摇滚乐手，才更要注意礼数啊！总不能因为喜欢摇滚，就让人觉得我没常识吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1066_001har", "source_sha256": "c4a33c97549be39cbdbe639328eda1f22504ddf1499c1645a0a35aaed4a24ec6", "ja": "たしかに……劇場に来てくれるお客さんも、\nロック系ファッションの人ほど礼儀正しいかも？", "zh": "确实……来剧场的客人中，穿摇滚风服装的人，说不定反而更懂礼貌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1067_025roc", "source_sha256": "6e43aeeeb67172836a81a6d9f8cb19b3ae6dff519f142a244a5187faedc95177", "ja": "なるほど、それが正しい\nロッカーズメソッドなんですね！", "zh": "原来如此，这就是正确的摇滚客之道啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1068_050jul", "source_sha256": "486436be47210d24835d02d2fb086c1f24f6b83d932ce161d1c67e4e3cff4eae", "ja": "そ、それはそれで、\nヘンなイメージがつきそうだな……。", "zh": "那、那样的话，总觉得会被贴上奇怪的标签……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1069_050jul", "source_sha256": "8c734dc9a870167f756d29a54ee78c20fd4264c1a1ef8b850af868d914ecabd0", "ja": "ていうかさ……その、あたしはみんなと違うだろ。\nその、王道のアイドルじゃない、っていうかさ……。", "zh": "话说啊……那个，我和大家不一样吧。\n那个，应该说……我不是那种正统偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_152_1070_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7fa4946828f968e2954ae0a4e4a5c5fb10caaa2358d4858feff8c9c718622fd7", "ja": "え？\nジュリアーノ、今気がついたの？", "zh": "咦？\n茱莉亚，你现在才发现吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
